flowchart TB
    Client[REST or WebSocket Client] --> API[FastAPI Interface]
    API --> Runtime[EMS Runtime]
    API --> EnergyService[Energy Configuration Services]
    EnergyService --> Tariff[Tariff Strategy]
    EnergyService --> Factory[Energy Source Factory]
    Factory --> Sources[Renewable Source Strategies]
    Tariff --> Provider[Simple Forecast Provider]
    Sources --> Provider
    Provider --> Metrics[GRID_PRICE and aggregate REN_PROD]
    Runtime --> EMS[EMS Application Service]
    EMS --> Metrics
    Metrics --> Params[Solver Parameters]
    Params --> Solvers[MILP or Heuristic Solver]
    EMS --> Subject[Consumption Subject]
    Subject --> Alert[Consumption Alert Observer]
    Alert --> Runtime
    Runtime --> Snapshot[Portfolio Metrics Sources and Alerts]
    Snapshot --> Client
